<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to June 6.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in month</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1   Sthn Pac Pete	  4.70   27.03</p>
<p> 2   Oil Search	     3.46   21.40</p>
<p> 3   David Jones	    1.84   15.00</p>
<p> 4   Argo Inv		 3.23   13.73</p>
<p> 5   CSL Limited	    8.26   13.15</p>
<p> 6   Seven Network	  5.45   11.45</p>
<p> 7   North Limited	  5.00   11.36</p>
<p> 8   Aust Foundation	2.52   11.01</p>
<p> 9   Winterthur Intl	3.09   10.36</p>
<p>10   Caltex Aust	    4.65    9.41</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in month</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1   Burns,Philp &amp; Co     1.98   -7.91</p>
<p> 2   FH Faulding	    7.40   -5.73</p>
<p> 3   News Corp		5.76   -4.64</p>
<p> 4   Centaur Min&amp;Expl     1.60   -4.19</p>
<p> 5   Syd Hrbr Casino	2.13   -4.05</p>
<p> 6   Plutonic Rsc	   4.75   -4.04</p>
<p> 7   News Corp-Prefd	4.76   -3.84</p>
<p> 8   Rothmans		 8.00   -3.73</p>
<p> 9   Email		    4.08   -3.55</p>
<p>10   Fosters Brew Grp     2.53   -3.44</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
